WEBVTT

00:07:30.779 --> 00:07:34.158
Guardians help honor
our responsibility of the land

00:07:34.158 --> 00:07:37.203
and they can create
a better future for all.

00:07:37.661 --> 00:07:40.831
Because guardianship
isn't just good for guardians,

00:07:40.831 --> 00:07:42.625
it's good for everyone

00:07:42.625 --> 00:07:45.753
because the land
is taking care of guardians

00:07:45.794 --> 00:07:48.214
and guardians are taking care of the land.

00:07:49.632 --> 00:07:52.843
Guardians help care
for some of the healthiest,

00:07:52.885 --> 00:07:55.221
most vibrant lands on the continent.

00:07:56.013 --> 00:07:57.556
Many work in the boreal forest

00:07:57.556 --> 00:07:59.934
which stretches from Alaska
to Newfoundland.